> >Another possibility might be one (or multiple) IBM SP/2 frames with a high speed switch.Two nodes (one as a High Availability node) in the frame would be running IBM Interactive Network Dispatcher, dispatching requests on the high speed switch.  The SP/2 can scale quite well, but its not cheap.
