Install the ATOM SDK that comes (for free) on the additional products
CDrom.

Then, once you have ATOM installed, do a "man third" for the
third-degree tool, which is essentially like Purify.

To use it, you say:

	% atom -o app.pure app -tool third
	% setenv LD_LIBRARY_PATH .

and then run 'app.pure' as you normally ran 'app'


