"group" quotas apply to the group as a whole, and not as a "prototypical
user." Thus all ownerships by a group are considered when calculating
quotas. (as opposed to (group_quota_limit*users_in_group). )

To answer in your own terms, a group quota "sets the quota for the entire
group".

